const activityLabels={'Consulta':'Consulta médica','Estudio':'Estudio médico','Pendiente':'Tarea pendiente','Trámite':'Gestión de salud','Cuidado':'Cuidado familiar','Medicación':'Tomar medicamento','Vacunación':'Vacunación'};
const activityLabel=type=>activityLabels[type]||type;
function recurrenceOf(r){
 if(r?.recurrence){const times=r.recurrence.times||[...new Set(db.events.filter(e=>e.seriesId===r.seriesId).map(e=>e.time).filter(Boolean))];const slot=r.seriesSlot??Math.max(0,times.indexOf(r.time));return {...r.recurrence,secondTime:times.find((t,i)=>i!==slot)||''}}
 if(!r?.seriesId)return {frequency:'once',weekdays:[],secondTime:''};
 const siblings=db.events.filter(e=>e.seriesId===r.seriesId),times=[...new Set(siblings.map(e=>e.time).filter(Boolean))].sort();
 return {frequency:/semana/i.test(r.seriesLabel||'')?'weekly':/mes/i.test(r.seriesLabel||'')?'monthly':/dos horarios/i.test(r.seriesLabel||'')?'once':'daily',weekdays:[...new Set(siblings.filter(e=>e.date).map(e=>new Date(e.date+'T12:00').getDay()))],secondTime:times.find(t=>t!==r.time)||''};
}
function recurrenceFields(r){const rec=recurrenceOf(r),freq=rec.frequency;return `${r?.seriesId?`<div class="notice"><strong>Esta actividad se repite</strong><p>${esc(r.seriesLabel)} · hasta ${dateLabel(r.seriesUntil)}.</p></div><label for="edit-scope">¿Qué actividades querés actualizar?</label><select id="edit-scope" name="editScope" required><option value="">Elegí una opción</option><option value="this">Solo esta actividad</option><option value="future">Esta y las próximas pendientes</option></select><p class="tiny muted">Las actividades realizadas y las fechas anteriores se conservan.</p>`:''}<label for="event-frequency">Se repite</label><select id="event-frequency" name="frequency">${[['once','Una sola vez'],['daily','Todos los días'],['weekly','Cada semana'],['monthly','Cada mes']].map(([v,l])=>`<option value="${v}" ${freq===v?'selected':''}>${l}</option>`).join('')}</select><details class="repeat-options" ${freq!=='once'||rec.secondTime?'open':''}><summary>Configurar repetición y horarios</summary><fieldset class="weekday-options" ${freq==='weekly'?'':'hidden'}><legend>Días de la semana</legend>${['Domingo','Lunes','Martes','Miércoles','Jueves','Viernes','Sábado'].map((d,i)=>`<label class="check"><input name="weekdays" type="checkbox" value="${i}" ${(rec.weekdays||[]).includes(i)?'checked':''}>${d}</label>`).join('')}</fieldset><label>Segundo horario (opcional)</label><input type="time" name="secondTime" value="${esc(rec.secondTime||'')}"><label>Repetir hasta</label><input name="repeatUntil" type="date" value="${r?.seriesUntil||addDay(r?.date||selected||today(),30)}"><p class="tiny muted">Ingresá la frecuencia y los horarios de la indicación recibida.</p></details>`}
function eventEditor(s,r){return sheet(r?'Editar actividad':'Nueva actividad',`<form id="event-form"><label for="event-owner">¿Para quién?</label><select id="event-owner" name="owner">${patientOptions('agenda',r?.owner||s.owner||(filter!=='all'?filter:allowedPatients('agenda')[0]))}</select><label for="event-title">¿Qué hay que hacer?</label><input id="event-title" name="title" value="${esc(r?.title||'')}" placeholder="Ej. control con medicina general" required><div class="inline"><div><label for="event-date">Fecha (opcional)</label><input id="event-date" type="date" name="date" value="${r?.date??selected}"></div><div><label for="event-time">Hora (opcional)</label><input id="event-time" type="time" name="time" value="${r?.time||''}"></div></div>${recurrenceFields(r)}<details class="event-extra"><summary>Responsable, aviso y otros detalles</summary><label>Tipo de actividad</label><select name="type">${['Consulta','Estudio','Pendiente','Trámite','Cuidado','Medicación','Vacunación'].map(t=>`<option value="${t}" ${(r?.type||'Pendiente')===t?'selected':''}>${activityLabel(t)}</option>`).join('')}</select><label>Responsable</label><select name="assignee">${actors.filter(p=>p===user||p===r?.assignee||user==='sofia').map(p=>`<option value="${p}" ${(r?.assignee||user)===p?'selected':''}>${people[p].name}</option>`).join('')}</select><label>Lugar</label><input name="location" value="${esc(r?.location||'')}" placeholder="Prestador o dirección"><label>Recordatorio</label><select name="reminder">${['Sin recordatorio','30 minutos antes','1 día antes','2 días antes','1 semana antes'].map(t=>`<option ${r?.reminder===t?'selected':''}>${t}</option>`).join('')}</select><label>Destinatario del aviso</label><select name="recipient">${actors.filter(p=>p===user||p===r?.recipient||p===r?.owner||user==='sofia').map(p=>`<option value="${p}" ${(r?.recipient||r?.assignee||user)===p?'selected':''}>${people[p].name}</option>`).join('')}</select><label>Notas y preparación</label><textarea name="notes">${esc(r?.notes||'')}</textarea>${privateField(r||{owner:user,visibility:'shared'})}</details><div class="actions"><button class="btn full">Guardar actividad</button></div></form>${!r?`<details><summary>Usar un ejemplo</summary>${activityExamples()}</details>`:''}`)}
function seriesBlock(e){if(!e.seriesId)return '';const siblings=db.events.filter(x=>x.seriesId===e.seriesId&&can(x,'care'));return `<div class="notice"><strong>Actividad repetida</strong><p>${esc(e.seriesLabel)} · hasta ${dateLabel(e.seriesUntil)}.</p><small>Este registro corresponde al ${dateLabel(e.date)} a las ${esc(e.time)}. Completarlo no completa los demás.</small>${siblings.some(x=>x.status==='pending'&&x.date>=today())?button('Detener próximas repeticiones','stop-series',e.id,'btn quiet full'):''}</div>`}
function routineSheet(s){if(s.type!=='stop-series')return false;const e=db.events.find(x=>x.id===s.id);if(!can(e,'care')||!e.seriesId){denied();return true}sheet('Detener repeticiones',`<p>Se cancelarán las actividades pendientes de esta serie desde hoy. Los registros realizados y las fechas anteriores se conservan.</p>${button('Confirmar: detener repeticiones','confirm-stop-series',e.id,'btn full')}`);return true}
function saveRoutine(form,f,v,s){
 if(form.id!=='event-form')return false;
 const prior=s?.id?db.events.find(e=>e.id===s.id):null,rec=recurrenceOf(prior),isRepeated=prior?.seriesId;
 if(!isRepeated&&v.frequency==='once'&&!v.secondTime)return false;
 if((prior&&!can(prior,'care'))||!canOwner(v.owner,(user==='rosa'||v.type==='Cuidado')?'care':'calendar')){denied();return true}
 if(isRepeated&&!['this','future'].includes(v.editScope)){toast('Elegí si querés cambiar solo esta actividad o también las próximas.');return true}
 const category=user==='rosa'||v.type==='Cuidado'?'care':'calendar';
 const data={owner:prior?.source?prior.owner:v.owner,title:v.title.trim(),type:v.type,scope:category,assignee:v.assignee,recipient:v.recipient,location:v.location,notes:v.notes,reminder:v.reminder,visibility:v.owner===user&&v.private?'private':prior?.visibility==='private'&&prior.owner!==user?'private':'shared'};
 if(isRepeated&&v.editScope==='this'){
  const days=f.getAll('weekdays').map(Number),changed=v.frequency!==rec.frequency||v.secondTime!==rec.secondTime||v.repeatUntil!==prior.seriesUntil||(v.frequency==='weekly'&&JSON.stringify(days.slice().sort())!==JSON.stringify((rec.weekdays||[]).slice().sort()));
  if(changed){toast('Para cambiar la frecuencia, elegí «Esta y las próximas pendientes».');return true}
  if(prior.date!==v.date||prior.time!==v.time||prior.assignee!==v.assignee){prior.response=null;prior.simulatedRepeats=0;if(prior.assignee!==v.assignee)prior.reassignment=null}if(prior.tracking?.stage==='to_book'){if(prior.tracking.targetDate&&v.date>prior.tracking.targetDate){toast('El inicio de gestión debe ser anterior o igual al objetivo.');return true}prior.tracking={...prior.tracking,planDate:v.date}}Object.assign(prior,data,{date:v.date,time:v.time});log(prior,'Editó solo esta actividad de la serie');selected=prior.date||today();saved('Se actualizó solo esta actividad');return true;
 }
 const start=v.date,end=v.frequency==='once'?v.date:v.repeatUntil,times=[v.time,v.secondTime].filter(Boolean).sort(),days=f.getAll('weekdays').map(Number);
 if(!data.title||!start||!end||!v.time||end<start||new Date(end+'T12:00')-new Date(start+'T12:00')>366*86400000){toast('Completá título, fecha, hora y fin de repetición (hasta un año).');return true}
 if(new Set(times).size!==times.length){toast('Los dos horarios deben ser distintos.');return true}
 if(v.frequency==='weekly'&&!days.length){toast('Elegí al menos un día de la semana.');return true}
 const dates=[];
 if(v.frequency==='monthly'){const anchor=new Date(start+'T12:00');for(let n=0;n<=12;n++){const first=new Date(anchor.getFullYear(),anchor.getMonth()+n,1,12),last=new Date(first.getFullYear(),first.getMonth()+1,0).getDate();first.setDate(Math.min(anchor.getDate(),last));const date=`${first.getFullYear()}-${String(first.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')}-${String(first.getDate()).padStart(2,'0')}`;if(date>end)break;dates.push(date)}}
 else for(let d=start;d<=end;d=addDay(d,1))if(v.frequency!=='weekly'||days.includes(new Date(d+'T12:00').getDay()))dates.push(d);
 if(!dates.length){toast('No hay días elegidos dentro de esas fechas.');return true}
 const future=isRepeated?db.events.filter(e=>e.seriesId===prior.seriesId&&e.status==='pending'&&(e.date>prior.date||e.date===prior.date&&(e.time||'')>=(prior.time||''))):prior?[prior]:[];
 if(future.some(e=>!can(e,'care'))){denied();return true}
 const samePattern=isRepeated&&v.date===prior.date&&v.frequency===rec.frequency&&v.secondTime===rec.secondTime&&v.repeatUntil===prior.seriesUntil&&(v.frequency!=='weekly'||JSON.stringify(days.slice().sort())===JSON.stringify((rec.weekdays||[]).slice().sort()));
 const beforeEvents=JSON.stringify(db.events);
 if(samePattern){
  const delta=Math.round((new Date(start+'T12:00')-new Date(prior.date+'T12:00'))/86400000),oldTime=prior.time;
  const changes=future.map(e=>({e,date:addDay(e.date,delta),time:e.time===oldTime?v.time:e.time}));
  if(changes.some(({date,time})=>db.events.some(e=>e.seriesId===prior.seriesId&&e.status==='done'&&e.date===date&&e.time===time))){toast('Ya hay una actividad realizada en esa fecha y horario. Elegí otro horario.');return true}
  if(changes.some(({e,date})=>e.tracking?.stage==='to_book'&&e.tracking.targetDate&&date>e.tracking.targetDate)){toast('El inicio de gestión debe ser anterior o igual al objetivo.');return true}
  for(const {e,date,time} of changes){if(e.date!==date||e.time!==time||e.assignee!==data.assignee){e.response=null;e.simulatedRepeats=0;if(e.assignee!==data.assignee)e.reassignment=null}if(e.tracking?.stage==='to_book')e.tracking={...e.tracking,planDate:date};Object.assign(e,data,{date,time});const seriesTimes=[...new Set([oldTime,rec.secondTime].filter(Boolean))].sort().map(t=>t===oldTime?v.time:t).sort();e.recurrence={...rec,times:seriesTimes,secondTime:seriesTimes.find(t=>t!==time)||''};e.seriesSlot=seriesTimes.indexOf(time);e.history??=[];e.history.push({by:user,at:stamp(),action:'Editó esta actividad y las próximas pendientes'})}
  if(!persist()){db.events=JSON.parse(beforeEvents);return true}selected=start;saved('Se actualizó esta actividad y las próximas pendientes');return true;
 }
 const seriesId=id(),label=v.frequency==='weekly'?'Cada semana: '+days.map(i=>['domingo','lunes','martes','miércoles','jueves','viernes','sábado'][i]).join(', '):v.frequency==='daily'?'Todos los días':v.frequency==='monthly'?'Cada mes':times.length>1?'Dos horarios en el día':'Una sola vez';
 const completed=isRepeated?db.events.filter(e=>e.seriesId===prior.seriesId&&e.status==='done'):[],oldTimes=[...new Set([prior?.time,rec.secondTime].filter(Boolean))].sort();
 const records=dates.flatMap(date=>times.filter((time,slot)=>!(isRepeated&&date===prior.date&&slot<oldTimes.indexOf(prior.time))&&!completed.some(e=>e.date===date&&(e.time===time||oldTimes.indexOf(e.time)===slot))).map(time=>{const template=future.find(e=>e.date===date&&e.time===time)||prior;return {...template,...data,id:id(),date,time,seriesSlot:times.indexOf(time),status:'pending',response:null,reassignment:null,simulatedRepeats:0,...(template?.tracking?.stage==='to_book'?{tracking:{...template.tracking,planDate:date}}:{}),...(v.frequency!=='once'||times.length>1?{seriesId,seriesLabel:label,seriesUntil:end,recurrence:{frequency:v.frequency,weekdays:days,secondTime:v.secondTime||'',times}}:{seriesId:undefined,seriesLabel:undefined,seriesUntil:undefined,recurrence:undefined}),history:[...(template?.history||[]),{by:user,at:stamp(),action:prior?'Creó actividad con nueva frecuencia':'Creó actividad repetida con fechas y horarios ingresados'}]}}));
 if(!records.length){toast('Las actividades de ese período ya están realizadas.');return true}
 if(records.some(e=>e.tracking?.stage==='to_book'&&e.tracking.targetDate&&e.date>e.tracking.targetDate)){toast('El inicio de gestión debe ser anterior o igual al objetivo.');return true}
 const before=JSON.stringify(db.events);
 if(prior){future.forEach(e=>{e.status='canceled';e.history??=[];e.history.push({by:user,at:stamp(),action:'Reemplazó por la nueva frecuencia de la serie'})})}
 db.events.push(...records);if(!persist()){db.events=JSON.parse(before);return true}selected=records[0].date;tab='calendar';calSection='agenda';saved(prior?'Se actualizó esta actividad y las próximas pendientes':`${records.length} actividades creadas hasta ${dateLabel(end)}`);return true;
}
const routineActions={'stop-series':id=>open('stop-series',id),'confirm-stop-series':eid=>{const e=db.events.find(x=>x.id===eid);if(!can(e,'care')||!e.seriesId)return denied();db.events.filter(x=>x.seriesId===e.seriesId&&can(x,'care')&&x.status==='pending'&&x.date>=today()).forEach(x=>{x.status='canceled';x.history??=[];x.history.push({by:user,at:stamp(),action:'Detuvo próximas repeticiones'})});saved('Próximas repeticiones canceladas; historial conservado')}};

function activityExamples(){return `<p>Elegí un ejemplo y completalo con tus datos.</p><div class="chips">${button('Sacar hora','activity-example','appointment','chip')}${button('Consulta médica','activity-example','consultation','chip')}${button('Tomar medicamento','activity-example','medicine','chip')}${button('Vacunación','activity-example','vaccine','chip')}</div>`}
routineActions['activity-example']=kind=>{const form=document.querySelector('#event-form');if(!form)return;const examples={appointment:['Sacar hora con el traumatólogo','Pendiente'],consultation:['Consulta médica con el traumatólogo','Consulta'],medicine:['Tomar medicamento: completar nombre','Medicación'],vaccine:['Vacunación: completar nombre','Vacunación']};const ex=examples[kind];if(!ex)return;form.elements.title.value=ex[0];form.elements.type.value=ex[1];if(kind==='medicine'){form.elements.time.value='09:00';form.elements.secondTime.value='22:00';form.elements.frequency.value='daily';form.querySelector('.repeat-options').open=true;toast('Ejemplo de horarios: revisalos según la indicación recibida.')}else{form.elements.frequency.value='once';form.elements.secondTime.value=''}form.elements.title.focus()};

document.addEventListener('change',e=>{if(e.target.name!=='frequency')return;const form=e.target.closest('#event-form');if(!form)return;const details=form.querySelector('.repeat-options');details.open=e.target.value!=='once';form.querySelector('.weekday-options').hidden=e.target.value!=='weekly'});
